      "category": "inherited-English-definition",
      "title": "Replace the circular something gloss",
      "problem": "Anything; something repeats the headword and treats anything as an unqualified equivalent. The sentence uses an unspecified or unidentified thing, not a free-choice anything. Its Korean definition and example translations already communicate the intended sense.",
      "suggestedFix": {
